{"account_signals":["Bulk approval limit 200 per batch"],"category":"feature_request","confidence":0.9,"customer_reply":"Thank you for reaching out. The bulk‑approve function in eProcurement is intentionally limited to 200 documents per batch. That’s why the Approve button is disabled when you select more than 200 POs. You can work around this by filtering the list into batches of 200 or fewer and approving each batch separately.

If you would like to increase the limit, we can log a feature request for you. We’ve forwarded your request to the Product team and will keep you updated on any changes.

